[node name="PumpHall" type="Node3D" parent="."]
editor_description = "C: the jackpot. The motor sits on its pump base down in the pit, under the hoist rail. Unbolt it, hoist it up through the gap in the railing and over the water main (lift it high!), lower it onto the trolley, then push the trolley out through the damaged corridor (short) or back down through the pit and the service tunnel (long, steep, floods).
The hoist is driven from the booth up the east wall: its window looks down the rail.
The hall's door to the bay is 1 m wide: crew and the VFD fit, the trolley does not."

